      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Naming instances in this fashion has never truly been supported, and none of our systems ever generate an instanceId which includes an `_` in that section.\n\nWhile it is regrettable that the instance view on the website doesn't raise the error, that view needs to be redone as it is, and editing it to fix something we don't officially support is very low priority.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
